**Constraints**
- `1 <= N <= 200000`
- `-10^9 <= nums[i], target <= 10^9`
- `nums` is sorted in non-decreasing order.
- A linear scan to find the two indices is `O(N)` and will time out on the full test set. The intended solution performs two binary searches (lower and upper bound) in `O(log N)`.

